Epic: bd-01KXYJK0XSA3RNH9ANMVC96EPE

Replace scalafim.linalg.DoubleMatrix and DoubleVector across production module boundaries with Gale DMat and DVec while preserving precise Scalafim domain wrappers and validation APIs.

Rules
- do not create permanent public Scalafim aliases for Gale carriers;
- a private temporary conversion shim is allowed only with a named deletion gate and allocation tests;
- rewrite hot primitive-array construction through the reviewed Gale builder or workspace seam rather than Seq boxing, element closures, or copy-per-call adapters;
- preserve zero-size, finiteness, serialization, equality, and ownership semantics explicitly where they differ.

Acceptance
All affected JVM and JS modules compile and their focused suites pass. Direct dataArray and DoubleMatrix.unsafe dependencies are eliminated or converted to reviewed Gale construction APIs. Allocation checks cover representative dense transforms and OLS response blocks.
